			"notes": "# v1.1.0\n\n  Paper: Axiom integration\n  - Players with safezone.axiom can connect with Axiom; block edits are restricted to claims they own or are\n  trusted in\n  - Admin players with safezone.command.admin bypass the restriction\n\n  Paper: FastAsyncWorldEdit / WorldEdit integration\n  - Player edit sessions are restricted to claims they own or are trusted in via FAWE's FaweMaskManager\n  - Requires region-restrictions: true in FastAsyncWorldEdit/config.yml and the fawe.SafeZone permission granted\n   to players\n  - Plain WorldEdit (without FAWE) is supported via extent injection\n  - Admin players bypass the restriction\n\n  Other\n  - Artifact names updated to SafeZone-Fabric-<version>.jar and SafeZone-Paper-<version>.jar for consistency\n  - Updated GUI for trusted and non trusted players in an owned claim\n\n  ---\n  Known limitation: when a WorldEdit selection is entirely outside a player's claim areas, FAWE silently applies\n   the restriction (no blocks change) but still reports \"Operation completed.\" This is a FAWE batch-mask\n  limitation with no clean workaround."
		}
